# Preventing Alcohol Abuse in the Greek System on a Commuter Campus: Prevention Contracts.

**Authors:** Hunnicutt, David M., And Others

## Abstract
Provides an overview of alcohol use and abuse on the college campus. Discusses theory behind alcohol abuse prevention contracts. Presents an example of how to use contracts to address alcohol abuse in a commuter university Greek system. Concludes solving the problems associated with college students' drinking is now more critical than ever. (Author/ABL)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ426741

